      "informal_name": "Addition of One Preserves Strict Inequality in Ordered Types",
      "kind": "theorem",
      "type": "∀ {α : Type u_1} {x y : α} [inst : Preorder α] [inst_1 : Add α] [inst_2 : One α] [SuccAddOrder α], x < y → x + 1 ≤ y",
      "informal_description": "For any elements $x$ and $y$ in a preorder $\\alpha$ with addition and a distinguished element $1$, if $x < y$, then $x + 1 \\leq y$.",
